<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SEVILLA JOIN BATTLE TO SIGN BEBETO.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SEVILLA JOIN BATTLE TO SIGN BEBETO.</headline>
<dateline>SEVILLE, Spain 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish side Sevilla have joined England's Blackburn Rovers in the battle to sign Brazilian World Cup forward Bebeto from Flamengo.</p>
<p>&quot;He wants to come back to Spain. We should know by the end of the week,&quot; a source at Sevilla said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Bebeto has struggled since joining Flamengo from Deportivo Coruna in the close-season and may even see his place in the side under threat when newly-signed international strike partner Romario recovers from injury.</p>
